---
// Sección de apoyo - Ko-fi y GitHub Sponsors
---

<section id="apoyo" class="py-20 px-6 bg-surface-alt transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    
    <span class="text-ink-soft font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm">Apoyá el proyecto</span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-ink mt-3 mb-4">
      Software libre necesita <span class="text-ink-soft">sostén</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-ink-soft max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      SportDharma Ecosystem es 100% abierto y gratuito. Si te sirve, podés contribuir de estas formas:
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Ko-fi -->
      <a href="https://ko-fi.com/sportdharma" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-surface border-2 border-line rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-ink hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">☕</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Ko-fi</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">Invitame un café. Aportes únicos o mensuales. Sin comisiones abusivas.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-ink font-bold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Aportar →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- GitHub Sponsors -->
      <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/Favio31" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-surface border-2 border-line rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-ink hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🐙</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">GitHub Sponsors</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">Financiamiento recurrente para mantenimiento y nuevas features.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-4 text-ink font-bold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Sponsorizar →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Otras formas de contribuir -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-line transition-colors duration-300">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-4">Otras formas de contribuir</h3>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-sm">
        <span class="bg-surface px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-line text-ink-soft transition-colors duration-300">🐛 Reportar bugs</span>
        <span class="bg-surface px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-line text-ink-soft transition-colors duration-300">📝 Proponer contenido</span>
        <span class="bg-surface px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-line text-ink-soft transition-colors duration-300">🌐 Traducir</span>
        <span class="bg-surface px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-line text-ink-soft transition-colors duration-300">💻 Pull requests</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>